{"id":"schmerz","lemma":"Schmerz","pos":"noun","rank":987,"glosses":["physical pain, ache (practically, as a sensation)","physical pain (theoretically, as a bodily mechanism or function)","emotional pain, sorrow, heartache"],"ipa":"/ʃmɛʁts/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7c/De-Schmerz.ogg/De-Schmerz.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schmerzes","plural":"Schmerzen"},"formAudio":{"Schmerzes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/61/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Schmerzes.wav","Schmerzen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9c/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Schmerzen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Schmerz war schrecklich.","en":"The pain was terrible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757603","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"awfully, terribly"}]},{"text":"Ich fühle deinen Schmerz.","en":"I feel your pain.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to feel","l":"fühlen"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null]},{"text":"Ich kenne ihren Schmerz.","en":"I feel their pain.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392485","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null]},{"text":"Der Schmerz ist weg.","en":"The pain has gone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69540","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"away"}]},{"text":"Zeig mir, wo der Schmerz ist.","en":"Show me where the pain is.","words":[{"g":"to point","l":"zeigen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]}]}